Get the current weather in Tokyo and output it as JSON matching this schema. Include a recommendation for what to wear.

Schema:
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "location": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "temperature_celsius": {
      "type": "number"
    },
    "condition": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "recommendation": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "location",
    "temperature_celsius",
    "condition",
    "recommendation"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

